+    A15: C(2), B15: C(71744.11624119806), C15: C(15797.76), D15: C(46621.96), E15: C(6993.29), F15: C(2331.1),
+    A16: C(3), B16: C(71744.11624119806), C16: C(16393.02), D16: C(46125.91), E16: C(6918.89), F16: C(2306.3),
